h driver information and authenticate ID number , if ID number coherent with driver info , send back driver information to User and continue call car order . record user location  and alert if ID not coherent. 3．Driver License Number Recognition : Application can recognize driver license digit number ,and also can send to web server for authentication & feed back result to user. ","full_name":"18601949127/DiDiCallCar","gain_source":{"15d":"history","180d":"history","1d":"snapshot","30d":"history","365d":"history","7d":"snapshot","90d":"history"},"gains":{"15d":2,"180d":13,"1d":0,"30d":3,"365d":24,"7d":1,"90d":7},"github_url":"https://github.com/18601949127/DiDiCallCar","history_pending":false,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxODIwNDI0NTg=","stars":1168},{"description":null,"full_name":"HiddenRamblings/TagMo","gain_source":{"15d":"history","180d":"history","1d":"snapshot","30d":"history","365d":"history","7d":"snapshot","90d":"history"},"gains":{"15d":3,"180d":70,"1d":0,"30d":8,"365d":149,"7d":0,"90d":28},"github_url":"https://github.com/HiddenRamblings/TagMo","history_pending":false,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk1MDg4MDA2MA==","stars":3222},{"description":"You don't have the time to watch all the WWDC session videos yourself? No problem me and many contributors extracted the gist for you 🥳","full_name":"Blackjacx/WWDC","gain_source":{"15d":"history","180d":"history","1d":"snapshot","30d":"history","365d":"history","7d":"snapshot","90d":"history"},"gains":{"15d":1,"180d":7,"1d":0,"30d":1,"365d":16,"7d":0,"90d":6},"github_url":"https://github.com/Blackjacx/WWDC","history_pending":false,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxOTIyMDIxNjM=","stars":2597},{"description":"A GUI Mifare Classic tool on Windows（停工/最新版v1.7.0）","full_name":"xcicode/MifareOneTool","gain_source":{"15d":"history","180d":"history","1d":"snapshot","30d":"history","365d":"history","7d":"snapshot","90d":"history"},"gains":{"15d":5,"180d":51,"1d":1,"30d":8,"365d":99,"7d":0,"90d":28},"github_url":"https://github.c